The '''Binghoe''' is an {{Epic}} [[Hoe]] obtainable on [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profiles.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Binghoe''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} or {{NPCSprite|Chuckleton}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Hoe
|rarity = epic
|farming_fortune = 25
|special_effect = Gives {{Stat|Farming Fortune|+5}} for each Bingo Goal completed.
}}

== Trivia ==
*As it is {{Soulbound}}, the '''Binghoe''' cannot be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile to any other profile.

